                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-807">Nazca Surface Lines, Primeval River Valleys & Flying Andor Genesis, Xevious (Arcade). Xeviousis an arcade game designed by Masanobu Endoh, one of Japan's most respected game creators and the mastermind behind Namco's later arcade hit of '84,The Tower of Druaga. Visually, it contained realistically shaded enemy characters, and an eyepopping scrolling background which went beyond what most arcade gamers had seen at the time. This is the first game in theXeviousseries.</p>
