                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-811">Floating Castle Balconies, Step Obstacles & Mazes, Hopping Mappy (Arcade). Hopping Mappyis an arcade game that was released byNamcoin1986. It runs on the company's System 86 hardware, and as the name suggests, it is the sequel toMappy- which was released three years earlier. It is also the first game from Namco that allowed scores not ending in "0" - the others areBakutotsu Kijūtei,Metal Hawk,Golly!</p>
