                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-813">Sinking Island Cliffs, Perimeter Fault Lines & Coral Seas, Dig Dug II (Arcade). Whether he pumps the enemies or sinks them in the sea, Dig Dug must hop from one island to the next exterminating the nuisances. even if it means demolishing half of the island. Dig Dug is on the job once again.</p>
