                <img class="world-img" src="https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/f/f0/New_Rally-X_Windows1.jpg" alt="New Rally-X - High-Speed Maze Courses, Smoke Screens & Rocky Barriers reference image" loading="lazy">
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-817">High-Speed Maze Courses, Smoke Screens & Rocky Barriers, New Rally-X (Arcade). While it went on to sell better than the original game, it did not seem to attract any attention from the home computer or console markets. WhenRally-Xfailed to win over the crowds,Namcoredesigned the game to address some of the complaints about the difficulty of the game that they had received. It seems, however, that New Rally-X's arrival may have been too little and too late.</p>
