                <img class="world-img" src="https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/thumb/3/3f/Tower_of_Druaga_PCE_case.jpg/800px-Tower_of_Druaga_PCE_case.jpg" alt="The Tower of Druaga - 60-Floor Mazes, Stone Pillars, Chests & Portals reference image" loading="lazy">
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-819">60-Floor Mazes, Stone Pillars, Chests & Portals, The Tower of Druaga (Arcade). This is the first game in theBabylonian Castle Sagaseries. For other games in the series see theBabylonian Castle Saga category. It appears to be a maze game, in which a knight must navigate various corridors, fighting off monsters and searching for the key that leads to the next floor.</p>
