                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-829">Arboreal Jungle Vine Ropes, Chains & Island Keeps, Donkey Kong Jr. (Arcade). told the next chapter in the ongoing saga between Mario andDonkey Kong, and introduced Kong's son as the new hero. Coleco again scored the home cartridge rights while Atari grabbed the rights for the computer diskette version. WhenDonkey Kong Jr.showed up in the arcades in1982, it demonstrated Shigeru Miyamoto's ability to not only create a sequel in terms of game play, but a spiritual successor in terms of story.</p>
