                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-861">4-Corner Citadels, Masonry Fortresses & Rebounding Fireballs, Warlords (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). It features the use of paddle controllers instead of joysticks. It featuredmultiplayerplay through wireless. Warlordsis anarcadegame released byAtariin1980.</p>
