                <h3>Combat</h3>
                <h4>Tank Brick Arenas & Biplane Open Cloud Skies</h4>
                <img class="world-img" src="https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/0/07/Combat_2600_screen2.png" alt="Combat - Tank Brick Arenas & Biplane Open Cloud Skies reference image" loading="lazy">
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-866">Tank Brick Arenas & Biplane Open Cloud Skies, Combat (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). The tank will stand still if the joystick is left in the neutral position. Only one missile per player can occupy the screen at one time.</p>
