                <span class="world-id">#867</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Battlezone</h3>
                <h4>3D Green Vector Wireframe Moonscapes & Geometric Volcanoes</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-867">3D Green Vector Wireframe Moonscapes & Geometric Volcanoes, Battlezone (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). This is the first game in theBattlezoneseries. For other games in the series see theBattlezone category. Battlezoneis a first-personshooterarcade game which was released byAtariin1980; it utilizes one Motorola M6502 (running at 1.512 MHz), with a Pokey sound chip running at that same speed, and a custom DAC.</p>
