                    <span class="badge coming-soon" title="Queued in Qwen3.5-3D-Coder synthesis pipeline">⏳ Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
                <span class="world-id">#868</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Defender</h3>
                <h4>Horizontally Looping Cylindrical Planetary Horizon</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-868">Horizontally Looping Cylindrical Planetary Horizon, Defender (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). The break-neck pace of the action made the game an easy choice for Atari to buy the home licensing rights. Atarisoft handled the conversion of the game to several other home console and computer platforms. This is the first game in theDefenderseries.</p>
                    <button class="expand-btn" onclick="toggleDesc('868', this)">Read more ▾</button>
