                <h3>Defender II (Stargate)</h3>
                <h4>Loop Space Horizons & Glowing Stargate Warp Rings</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-869">Loop Space Horizons & Glowing Stargate Warp Rings, Defender II (Stargate) (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). A vivid classic environment representing Loop Space Horizons & Glowing Stargate Warp Rings from Defender II (Stargate).</p>
