                <h3>Joust</h3>
                <h4>Volcanic Lava Pits, Rock Ledges & Pterodactyl Roosts</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-870">Volcanic Lava Pits, Rock Ledges & Pterodactyl Roosts, Joust (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). Set inside a cavern of sorts, complete with lava, the battle took place between floating segments of land. This is the first game in theJoustseries. For other games in the series see theJoust category.</p>
