            <div class="card-header">
                <div>
                    <span class="badge platform">Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800</span>
                    <span class="badge coming-soon" title="Queued in Qwen3.5-3D-Coder synthesis pipeline">⏳ Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
                <span class="world-id">#872</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Crystal Castles</h3>
                <h4>Isometric Honeycomb Step Castles & Glowing Gem Paths</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-872">Isometric Honeycomb Step Castles & Glowing Gem Paths, Crystal Castles (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). Due to the games appearance right around the time when the home video game market was crashing, Crystal Castles did not see as wide a variety of home conversions as it might have, appearing primarily on Atari systems, but making its way to other popular home computers, courtesy of Atarisoft. Crystal Castlesis an arcade game released byAtariin1983.</p>
                    <button class="expand-btn" onclick="toggleDesc('872', this)">Read more ▾</button>
                </div>
