                <div>
                    <span class="badge platform">Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800</span>
                    <span class="badge coming-soon" title="Queued in Qwen3.5-3D-Coder synthesis pipeline">⏳ Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
                <span class="world-id">#876</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Major Havoc</h3>
                <h4>Sector Space Flight & High-Oxygen Reactor Bases</h4>
                <img class="world-img" src="https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/2/28/Major_Havoc_gameplay.png" alt="Major Havoc - Sector Space Flight & High-Oxygen Reactor Bases reference image" loading="lazy">
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-876">Sector Space Flight & High-Oxygen Reactor Bases, Major Havoc (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). However, a few scientists escaped and cloned Havoc, who must now fly his "Catastrofighter" through a wormhole in space, leading his clone army against the Vaxxians to free his people (by destroying their reactors).</p>
                    <button class="expand-btn" onclick="toggleDesc('876', this)">Read more ▾</button>
