                <div>
                    <span class="badge platform">Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800</span>
                    <span class="badge coming-soon" title="Queued in Qwen3.5-3D-Coder synthesis pipeline">⏳ Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
                <span class="world-id">#877</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>I, Robot</h3>
                <h4>Flat-Shaded 3D Polygon Pyramids & Big Brother Eyes</h4>
                
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-877">Flat-Shaded 3D Polygon Pyramids & Big Brother Eyes, I, Robot (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). Each level has a strict time limit, and other enemies such as birds, balls, and flying sharks will try to prevent the robot from completing his task; between levels, the robot flies through outer space, and must shoot his way through a barrage of polygonal tetras, meteors and other obstacles (including, after each fourth level, a huge spike-spitting head) to reach the next board.</p>
                    <button class="expand-btn" onclick="toggleDesc('877', this)">Read more ▾</button>
                </div>
