                <div>
                    <span class="badge platform">Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800</span>
                    <span class="badge coming-soon" title="Queued in Qwen3.5-3D-Coder synthesis pipeline">⏳ Coming Soon</span>
                </div>
                <span class="world-id">#883</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3>Return of the Jedi (Atari 1984)</h3>
                <h4>Isometric Endor Forest & Death Star Core</h4>
                <img class="world-img" src="https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/e/ea/Return_of_the_Jedi_difficulty_selection_screen.png" alt="Return of the Jedi (Atari 1984) - Isometric Endor Forest & Death Star Core reference image" loading="lazy">
                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-883">Isometric Endor Forest & Death Star Core, Return of the Jedi (Atari 1984) (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). Once she reaches the Ewok Village and joins the Ewoks, C3-PO and R2-D2, the text "YOU MADE IT! BONUS FOR PHASE 1: 10000" shall appear on the screen. Once Chewbacca has reached the bunker, Han Solo will destroy it and deactivate the protective shield surrounding the Death Star so Calrissian can enter it, but no bonus will be awarded for clearing this level.</p>
                    <button class="expand-btn" onclick="toggleDesc('883', this)">Read more ▾</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="play-btn disabled-btn">⏳ Coming Soon — Queued</span>
