                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-905">Night Harbor Docks & Pagoda Courtyards, Real Bout Fatal Fury Special (Arcade (Neo Geo / SNK)). UnlikeFatal Fury Special, which was just an updated version ofFatal Fury 2,Real Bout Fatal Fury Specialdiffers enough fromReal Bout Fatal Furythat it is practically a new game in itself. The game takes place after the death ofGeese Howard, who returns as the secret final boss "Nightmare Geese".Cheng Sinzan,Tung Fu Rue,Laurence BloodandWolfgang Krauserall return with the entire cast of RBFF.</p>
