                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-906">Sunset Rail Bridges & Neon Streets, Real Bout Fatal Fury 2: The Newcomers (Arcade (Neo Geo / SNK)). Real Bout Fatal Fury 2: The Newcomerswas released in1998and was the official sequel toReal Bout Fatal Fury Special. Along with all the characters from RBFFS andAlfredas a hidden boss, two new characters are introduced:Li XiangfeiandRick Strowd. Plane shifting similar toFatal Fury 3replaces the system from RBFFS.</p>
