                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-909">Neo Geo Factory, Mediterranean Shores & Rugal's Silo, The King of Fighters '95 (Arcade (Neo Geo / SNK)). The gameplay ofThe King of Fighters '95was left largely intact fromThe King of Fighters '94. In addition, almost all the teams from the first game returned, but were no longer affiliated with specific nationalities. The King of Fighters '95 marked the beginning of the Orochi Saga, which would continue inKOF '96andKOF '97.</p>
