                <div class="description-container">
                    <p class="description collapsed" id="desc-910">High-Rise Helipads, Shinto Temples & Coliseum Rings, The King of Fighters '96 (Arcade (Neo Geo / SNK)). The King of Fighters is an annual tournament uniting fighters from across the world, starting in 1994. During the time that had passed between the tournaments in 1995 and 1996, and the King of Fighters tournament's fame had grown immensely, to the point that it turned into a major international event, which had not happened before.</p>
